# UI theming (MatchReadyTX)

## Tokens first

- Prefer CSS variables from `src/styles/tokens.css` (`--rs-color-*`, `--rs-radius-*`, `--rs-font-*`).
- Do not introduce PatternFly default blue as brand; brand is black/white.
- Urgent / needs-action / LIVE-style accents use `--rs-color-urgent` (`#DC2626`) only — not for general chrome.

## Contrast

- Body text on white/light surfaces: `--rs-color-ink` / `--rs-color-primary` (black).
- On primary (black) fills: `--rs-color-on-primary` (white).
- Meta / secondary copy: `--rs-color-muted` — not low-contrast grey-on-grey.

## Layout

- Mobile-first: 2-up card grid (`.rs-card-grid`), chip filter scroller, fixed bottom nav with ~100px clearance.
- Document changes in `docs/THEME.md` when adding tokens.

## CSS file placement

- **Shared chrome:** `src/styles/shell/*.css` (barrel: `index.css`, imported from `main.tsx`).
- **Feature-only prefixes:** co-located `features/<area>/*.css`, imported from that feature’s layout or page.
- **No monolith:** do not add large style blocks to a single file; see `docs/THEME.md` for the prefix table.
- **No hex** outside `src/styles/tokens.css`.
